# Vox MENS — AI Coding Playground for the Vox Language

Interactive browser playground and release evidence viewer for the [{{NAMESPACE}}/vox-mens-index](https://huggingface.co/{{NAMESPACE}}/vox-mens-index) coding models (`0.8B`, `2B`, `4B`, `9B`, `27B`). Compare tuned models that write compiler-checked `.vox` full-stack code (tables, queries, UI components, and agents) side by side against the base weights, and copy ready-to-run Vox or Python snippets:

1. **Try Models in Your Browser or via Inference Providers**: Runs smaller sizes (`0.8B`–`4B`) directly on your browser's WebGPU device using `@huggingface/transformers`, or calls `https://router.huggingface.co/v1` / a local `vox mens serve` server for larger models (`9B`–`27B`). Supports both Candle and standard Hugging Face PEFT adapter bundles automatically.
2. **Live Release Verification & Examples**: Pulls real compiler-checked benchmark results (`ladder_index.json`, `gate_receipt.json`, `collateral_damage_report.json`) and held-out code samples straight from Hugging Face Hub at runtime.

